'''Jocs Importants''' is a [[video game developer|video game development]] and publishing company based in [[Dàrsena (ciutat)|Dàrsena]], [[Sant Cristòfor]], [[Balboa]]. Founded in 2009 by [[Job Tan]] and [[Mikael Vidal i Torres]], the company is best known as the developer and publisher of ''[[Galactic Combat]]'', one of the most popular [[{{w|multiplayer online battle arena|MOBA}}]] games in the world.

The company's first published title, ''Galactic Combat'', was released in 2011 and became a global success, establishing Jocs Importants as one of the most prominent technology companies in Balboa. The company has since expanded its operations to include competitive gaming events, merchandising, and multimedia partnerships related to the ''Galactic Combat'' franchise.

